1
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:03,930
Prince Yu is finally returning to the capital.

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,400
We have long heard that His Highness is wise and capable,

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,370
and most resembles His Majesty.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,530
Yet no one knows why His Majesty would not let him remain in the capital.

5
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:09,970
The thoughts of those above

6
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:11,200
are not for common folk like us to understand.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:34,470
Your Excellency.

8
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:35,530
Mm.

9
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:36,600
When will Prince Yu

10
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,570
arrive?

11
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,400
In reply to Your Excellency, a messenger sent word

12
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,030
that it would be around midday.

13
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:41,330
Judging by the hour, he should arrive soon.

14
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:41,900
You may withdraw.

15
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:55,170
Speak of the man, and here he comes.

16
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:56,470
And an impatient one, too.

17
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,900
Instead of following the horse escort,

18
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,000
he insists on rushing ahead.

19
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:02,100
Could he be in such a hurry to see my lord?

20
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,570
Prince Yu is returning.

21
00:01:09,970 --> 00:01:11,170
Greetings, Your Highness.

22
00:01:11,830 --> 00:01:13,300
Your Highness must be weary from the journey.

23
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,300
It has been a long road.

24
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:16,170
Mingke, there is no need for such formality between us.

25
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:17,230
Rise.

26
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:18,700
Thank you, Your Highness.

27
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:21,000
Why did Your Highness arrive in such a hurry?

28
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:21,670
I was eager to see you, so I came ahead.

29
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:22,130
I came first.

30
00:01:22,570 --> 00:01:23,300
So it really was.

31
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,000
Mingke, what are you laughing at?

32
00:01:26,370 --> 00:01:27,630
Let us enter the palace, Your Highness.

33
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:28,470
Her Highness is still waiting.

34
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:30,800
Let's go.

35
00:01:41,970 --> 00:01:43,729
It has been nearly ten years since we last saw each other.

36
00:01:44,030 --> 00:01:46,070
Have you been well all these years?

37
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:49,930
Whether well or not, I have lived through them.

38
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:51,229
One must look forward.

39
00:01:51,670 --> 00:01:52,630
If one cannot look forward,

40
00:01:52,729 --> 00:01:54,100
looking back now and then is also allowed.

41
00:01:55,630 --> 00:01:58,229
I did not ask just now. Who is this?

42
00:01:58,270 --> 00:01:59,830
This is General Helian Zhao of Weisu.

43
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:00,700
Her Highness favors him greatly.

44
00:02:00,830 --> 00:02:02,230
So this is General Helian Zhao.

45
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:03,130
I have long heard your name.

46
00:02:12,070 --> 00:02:13,300
To call me merely a general of Weisu

47
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:14,470
sounds far too distant, does it not?

48
00:02:14,470 --> 00:02:15,700
Does my lord not still regard me

49
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:17,030
as an ordinary friend?

50
00:02:18,130 --> 00:02:19,030
Your Highness is too courteous.

51
00:02:20,329 --> 00:02:21,870
I, too, have long heard of Your Highness.

52
00:02:22,530 --> 00:02:23,400
By the way, Mingke,

53
00:02:23,730 --> 00:02:25,100
I brought gifts from my fief.

54
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:32,600
Come and catch me!

55
00:02:33,670 --> 00:02:34,930
Since I went to my fief at twenty,

56
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:37,500
I have not returned for ten years.

57
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:40,370
Yet Shunjing City still looks the same.

58
00:02:42,570 --> 00:02:43,829
Do you still remember when we were children?

59
00:02:43,829 --> 00:02:45,570
You always chased after me, calling me Your Highness.

60
00:02:46,100 --> 00:02:47,430
Right here on this long street.

61
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:50,100
Back then, when you could not catch up with me,

62
00:02:50,100 --> 00:02:51,170
you would even cry.

63
00:02:55,770 --> 00:02:57,270
Your Highness, wait for me!

64
00:02:57,270 --> 00:02:58,500
Come on, come on!

65
00:03:02,430 --> 00:03:04,670
I want to find my mother!

66
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:10,500
Is that so?

67
00:03:11,130 --> 00:03:12,400
This servant does not remember.

68
00:03:22,730 --> 00:03:24,070
The Sericulture Rite is approaching.

69
00:03:24,430 --> 00:03:26,230
Who presides over it in the palace now?

70
00:03:26,530 --> 00:03:27,870
Is it Her Highness the Imperial Noble Consort?

71
00:03:28,470 --> 00:03:29,030
Yes.

72
00:03:31,170 --> 00:03:32,100
When my imperial mother was alive,

73
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:33,329
every year before the Sericulture Rite,

74
00:03:33,370 --> 00:03:34,570
you would pick mulberry leaves with me.

75
00:03:35,070 --> 00:03:36,270
If not for that case back then,

76
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:37,930
perhaps my mother and my second brother would not have died.

77
00:03:37,930 --> 00:03:38,670
Perhaps you and I...

78
00:03:38,670 --> 00:03:40,329
Your Highness, we have arrived at the palace gate.

79
00:03:44,900 --> 00:03:46,000
This prince spoke out of turn.

80
00:03:46,270 --> 00:03:47,900
Whether thunder or rain, all is the sovereign's grace.

81
00:03:48,170 --> 00:03:49,200
Your Highness is the sovereign,

82
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:50,270
and Mingke is a subject.

83
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,900
How could there be any such thing as speaking out of turn?

84
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:56,500
Whether I spoke out of turn is not for me to decide.

85
00:03:57,870 --> 00:03:58,530
When they wish to condemn someone,

86
00:03:58,530 --> 00:03:59,829
they never lack a pretext.

87
00:04:01,530 --> 00:04:03,500
It was the Chen family's horse in Shunjing that startled His Majesty.

88
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:05,030
What does that have to do with Prince Yu,

89
00:04:05,070 --> 00:04:05,700
who was far away in Wuchang presenting the horse?

90
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:06,530
Your Highness, please go in.

91
00:04:06,530 --> 00:04:07,330
His Majesty is still waiting for you.

92
00:04:08,230 --> 00:04:09,030
Very well.

93
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,130
Then I shall go.

94
00:04:24,830 --> 00:04:26,730
When one receives too little as a child,

95
00:04:27,270 --> 00:04:28,470
one grows fiercely jealous as an adult.

96
00:04:30,130 --> 00:04:31,300
A jealous shrew from the grasslands.

97
00:04:32,330 --> 00:04:34,100
Wrong. Marry a chicken, follow the chicken.

98
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:35,100
Marry a dog, follow the dog.

99
00:04:35,470 --> 00:04:36,970
So it is a jealous husband from the capital.

100
00:04:39,530 --> 00:04:40,400
He stood so close to you,

101
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,570
and you ignored me completely.

102
00:04:42,070 --> 00:04:43,300
I am so hurt.

103
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:45,370
You are far too bold.

104
00:04:46,470 --> 00:04:47,030
Lord Commander.

105
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:50,700
What is it?

106
00:04:53,270 --> 00:04:54,330
Come forward and speak.

107
00:04:54,470 --> 00:04:55,270
Reporting to the Lord Commander,

108
00:04:55,370 --> 00:04:56,730
when we searched and confiscated the Chen residence,

109
00:04:56,730 --> 00:04:58,630
we discovered evidence that Chen Lunda colluded with an enemy faction.

110
00:05:22,070 --> 00:05:24,230
Then Chen Lunda deserves death.

111
00:05:27,170 --> 00:05:28,270
Your Majesty.

112
00:05:28,270 --> 00:05:30,870
My father's been wronged.

113
00:05:30,870 --> 00:05:33,930
Your Majesty!

114
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:35,470
The Chen family has been wronged!

115
00:05:35,470 --> 00:05:38,570
Your Majesty, you cannot treat me this way!

116
00:05:38,570 --> 00:05:39,800
Your Majesty!

117
00:05:47,730 --> 00:05:50,270
Chen Lunda has long colluded with the foreign Jichuan tribe to smuggle goods,

118
00:05:50,270 --> 00:05:51,830
and secretly purchased more than three thousand warhorses.

119
00:05:51,970 --> 00:05:53,730
Their whereabouts remain unknown.

120
00:06:00,370 --> 00:06:02,670
He dared act right under my nose.

121
00:06:02,670 --> 00:06:04,170
He has truly rebelled against the heavens.

122
00:06:05,130 --> 00:06:07,700
This is strikingly similar to the old case of Marquis Dingyuan.

123
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:09,100
I ask Your Majesty to investigate thoroughly.

124
00:06:16,130 --> 00:06:17,930
Shan Muchuan colluded with an enemy state

125
00:06:17,930 --> 00:06:19,270
and concealed warhorses in secret.

126
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,030
He is to be executed after noon.

127
00:06:29,770 --> 00:06:30,830
Please investigate thoroughly, Your Majesty.

128
00:06:31,270 --> 00:06:32,530
We will discuss this later.

129
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:34,370
You may withdraw for now.

130
00:06:36,170 --> 00:06:37,800
There may be an injustice against the Shan clan.

131
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,530
Please investigate thoroughly, Your Majesty.

132
00:06:40,330 --> 00:06:41,030
Get out.

133
00:06:59,930 --> 00:07:02,070
Did everything go smoothly, Lord Commander?

134
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:03,930
His Majesty was unwilling to listen.

135
00:07:10,770 --> 00:07:12,200
What a coincidence, my lord.

136
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:13,300
We meet again.

137
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,800
General Helian,

138
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,330
how are you so idle all day?

139
00:07:20,900 --> 00:07:22,530
That is such a misunderstanding.

140
00:07:23,100 --> 00:07:23,830
I am not idle.

141
00:07:26,230 --> 00:07:27,930
Did I not happen to run into Your Excellency

142
00:07:27,930 --> 00:07:29,430
and hurry over to hold an umbrella for you?

143
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:30,500
You may withdraw.

144
00:07:32,330 --> 00:07:33,130
Yes.

145
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,900
Helian Zhao.

146
00:07:43,430 --> 00:07:44,230
What is it, my lord?

147
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:45,570
Did I fail to understand the rules

148
00:07:45,570 --> 00:07:46,430
and say the wrong thing?

149
00:07:47,230 --> 00:07:47,830
A barbarian like me

150
00:07:47,830 --> 00:07:49,430
truly does not understand the rules of the capital.

151
00:07:53,730 --> 00:07:54,630
You were waiting for me.

152
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,300
Could you not just treat this as a chance encounter?

153
00:07:57,430 --> 00:07:59,100
It would make us seem especially fated.

154
00:07:59,230 --> 00:08:00,800
Being fated with anyone else would be fine.

155
00:08:01,030 --> 00:08:02,200
Being fated with you would not.

156
00:08:04,230 --> 00:08:05,630
Then you are in trouble.

157
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:07,200
What exactly is it?

158
00:08:07,930 --> 00:08:09,330
You really are unmoved by either softness or force.

159
00:08:09,430 --> 00:08:10,100
Fine.

160
00:08:10,330 --> 00:08:11,000
First, I came

161
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,600
to see whether all my lord's careful scheming

162
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,930
had achieved what you wanted.

163
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:15,430
Judging by my lord's expression,

164
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:16,300
it seems it did not.

165
00:08:20,530 --> 00:08:21,730
This blade is for my lord.

166
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:24,930
I have countless things for self-defense.

167
00:08:25,230 --> 00:08:26,700
What do I need your blade for?

168
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,570
My lord has countless things for self-defense,

169
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:30,330
yet among them, you are missing me.

170
00:08:31,230 --> 00:08:33,169
My lord has stirred up such a great affair with the Chen family.

171
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,799
I imagine many will inevitably bear a grudge against you.

172
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:36,799
Having one more thing to protect yourself is no bad thing.

173
00:08:39,770 --> 00:08:41,600
The blade is fine. The person is unnecessary.

174
00:08:42,299 --> 00:08:43,429
How can that be?

175
00:08:43,770 --> 00:08:44,770
If you like the blade,

176
00:08:44,770 --> 00:08:46,230
you have to like the person, too.

177
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:52,500
I have not said the third reason yet.

178
00:08:53,230 --> 00:08:54,270
What is the third reason?

179
00:08:54,930 --> 00:08:57,100
Third, I like you, my lord.

180
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:24,930
My lord likes me, too.

181
00:09:25,470 --> 00:09:26,230
Enough nonsense.

182
00:09:26,330 --> 00:09:27,600
Weren't you going to hold the umbrella for me?

183
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,170
Walk.

184
00:09:28,870 --> 00:09:29,430
Coming.

185
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:31,130
Do not stand so close to me.

186
00:09:31,130 --> 00:09:32,000
I refuse.
